  <section class="personal-home">
    <h1>I invest in software.<br/>I’ve built it, too.</h1>
    <div class="home-bio">
      <p>I’m Sean, a partner at <a href="https://www.meritholdings.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Merit Holdings</a>. I’ve spent the last decade and a half building and investing in companies, from the earliest stages through growth.</p>
      <p>I’ve worked with teams at the “two people and a deck” stage, and with companies whose products are already delivering value but need to figure out how to reach more customers.</p>
